<title>BELGIUM: Sabena sees delays in August due to runway works.</title>
<headline>Sabena sees delays in August due to runway works.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian national airline Sabena said on Wednesday some of its flights might be delayed in August due to maintenance works on one of the three runways at Brussels airport.</p>
<p>&quot;These works could have an impact on the normal course of flight operations,&quot; Sabena said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it would offer additional assistance and information to passengers affected.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
